  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Unifix Care gives everyone access to safe surgical care</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Unifix Care is a start-up founded with the mission to give everyone access to safe surgical care, and focuses on producing surgical instruments for low- and middle-income countries. In addition, Unifix Care develops various test and control methods to measure the quality of the materials of medical instruments.Unifix offers surgical instruments that are qualitatively equal to Western standards, but that can compete in terms of price with qualitatively inferior instruments that are on the market in many low- and middle-income countries. Based on scientific substantiation and by applying their own developed quality and control equipment, Unifix has developed their own production blueprint for their surgical instruments. Large-scale sales to hospitals are preferred via distribution partners. First, they need to demonstrated in a real practical situation that the quality is indeed of a much higher level than instruments that are currently on the Kenyan market.</narrative>
  </description>
